abstract: >-
  Machine-readable results, figures, plotting scripts, and lightweight audit
  functions for an analysis that links liquid-hydrogen tank
  self-pressurization, pressure-safety-valve release, vent thermal state, and
  TNO-aligned conditional consequence indicators.
